  "title": "Sima Qian",
  "summary": "Sima Qian was a Han-dynasty court historian from Xiayang (modern Hancheng, Shaanxi) who succeeded his father Sima Tan as Grand Historian. Sentenced to castration in 99 BCE after defending the general Li Ling, he completed the Shiji, a 130-chapter history running from the legendary Yellow Emperor to the late first century BCE.",
